at:CN7a a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria: Processing and evident of service law, salary-related, training-related and other personal data directly related to 
the employment relationship of public servants and other persons paid by those responsible for the public sector (such as civil servants, contract staff, persons in training, temporary staff, but also deputies and civil servants) as
well as volunteers and civil servants (each without remuneration) by the service authorities and personnel departments for the purpose of individual personnel measures and statistical evaluations."@en ;
	dpv:hasResponsibleEntity dpv:PublicSectorBody ;
	dpv:hasPurpose hapt:tech-StatisticalEvaluations ;
    dpv:hasDataSubject hapt:dpv-CivilServant ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN7" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .

