at:CN15 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Control of the authorization of access to buildings and delimited areas by the owner or 
authorized user with the help of systems that process personal data with automated assistance, whereby no biometric data of data subjects are processed. The mere real-time reproduction of facial images is covered by this exception."@en ;
    dpv:hasDataSource hapt:dpv-ImageData, hapt:dpv-VideoData, hapt:pd-FacialImages ;
    dpv:isImplementedUsingTechnology hapt:tech-AutomatedAssistance ;
	dpv:hasPurpose dpv:PhysicalAccessControl ;
	dpv:hasLocation dpv:PrivateLocation ;
	dpv:isNotApplicableFor pd:Biometric ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN15" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .


at:CN16 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Stationary image processing and associated acoustic processing for monitoring purposes 
(video surveillance). Subject to conditions. Spatial recording area: Localities over which the person responsible is authorized to dispose. The video surveillance may not extend beyond the property, with the exception of an 
inevitable inclusion of public traffic areas to the extent of up to half a meter measured from the property boundary of the monitored object. In addition, video surveillance may not be operated in places that represent the most 
personal area of life of people. Storage period: Recorded personal data must be deleted by the controller after 72 hours at the latest, unless a longer storage period has been expressly stipulated in a law, by an official legal act, 
in a works agreement or with the consent of the personnel representation. Identification: The prerequisite for the exception is the appropriate identification of the image processing by the person responsible. In any case, the person 
responsible must be clearly stated from the marking."@en ;
	dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-VideoSurveillance, hapt:dpv-Monitoring ;
   	dpv:hasData tech:VideoContent, tech:AudioContent, hapt:tech-StationaryImages ;
	dpv:hasContext hapt:dpv-PropertyBoundaryLimitation ;
	dpv:isNotApplicableFor dpv:PrivateLocation ;
	dpv:hasStorageCondition hapt:dpv-RetentionPeriod "PT72H"^^xsd:duration ; ("add into usage note unless a longer storage period has been expressly stipulated in a law, by an official legal act, 
in a works agreement or with the consent of the personnel representation into definition of retention period"@en)
	dpv:hasResponsibleEntity dpv:Organisation ; 
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN16" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT ;
	dct:scopeNote " The organisation or person responsbile for the image processing must be clearly identifiable, it must be made clear who is responsible and this must be demonstrated by a mark or sign"@en . 


at:CN17a  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing, which serve the preventive protection of persons or things on
private properties used for residential purposes, which are used exclusively by the person responsible and by all authorized users living in the common household. The prerequisite is the consent of all authorized users."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PersonsPreventativeProtection, hapt:dpv-ResidentialPurpose  ;
	dpv:hasJustification dpv:ConsentProvided ;
    dpv:hasEntity hapt:dpv-PropertyOwner, hapt:dpv-AuthorisedUser ;
	dpv:hasData tech:ImageContent, tech:AudioContent ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN17" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .

at:CN17b  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing, which serve the preventive protection of persons or things on
private properties used for residential purposes, which are used exclusively by the person responsible and by all authorized users living in the common household. The prerequisite is the consent of all authorized users."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PropertyPreventativeProtection, hapt:dpv-ResidentialPurpose ;
	dpv:hasJustification dpv:ConsentProvided ;
    dpv:hasEntity hapt:dpv-PropertyOwner, hapt:dpv-AuthorisedUser ;
	dpv:hasData tech:ImageContent, tech:AudioContent ;
  	dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN17" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .


at:CN18a  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing, which are necessary for the preventive protection of persons 
or things in generally accessible places that are subject to the house law of the person responsible, due to violations of law that have already occurred or a special potential hazard in the nature of the place and no suitable means 
is available. In cases where employee representatives have to be formed, the existence of a valid works agreement or a valid consent of the personnel representation, which regulates the implementation of video surveillance, is a prerequisite.
This exception does not apply to places that may be entered due to an existing contract obligation or due to the public interest of anyone."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PreventativeProtectionOfThings ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PreventativeProtectionOfPersons ;
	dpv:hasData tech:ImageContent, tech:AudioContent ;
	dpv:hasLocation hapt:dpv-PotentiallyHazardousLocation ;
	dpv:hasStatus hapt:dpv-ViolationOccured ;
	dpv:hasLocation hapt:dpv-PotentiallyHazardousLocation ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN18" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .

at:CN18b  a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing, which are necessary for the preventive protection of persons 
or things in generally accessible places that are subject to the house law of the person responsible, due to violations of law that have already occurred or a special potential hazard in the nature of the place and no suitable means 
is available. In cases where employee representatives have to be formed, the existence of a valid works agreement or a valid consent of the personnel representation, which regulates the implementation of video surveillance, is a prerequisite.
This exception does not apply to places that may be entered due to an existing contract obligation or due to the public interest of anyone."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PreventativeProtectionOfThings ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-PreventativeProtectionOfPersons ;
	dpv:hasData tech:ImageContent, tech:AudioContent ;
	dpv:hasLocationLocality hapt:dpv-Workplace ;
	dpv:hasJustification justifications:ConsentProvided ;
	dpv:hasLegalBasis dpv:ControllerDataSubjectAgreement ;
	dpv:isNotApplicableFor dpv:PubliclyAssessibleSpace, hapt:dpv-ContractuallyAccessiblePlace, hapt:dpv-PublicInterestAccessiblePlace ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN18" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .

at:CN19 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Processing of image and acoustic data transmittions in real time without recording."@en ;
    dpv:hasContext hapt:dpv-RealtimeDataTransmissionWithoutStorage ;
	dpv:hasData tech:VideoContent, tech:AudioContent ;
	dpv:isNotApplicableFor hapt:dpv-Recording, hapt:dpv-DataStorage ;
    dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
    dct:identifier "CN19" ;
    dpv:hasJurisdiction loc:AT .


at:CN20 a impacto:eu-gdpr-DPIANotRequiredProcess ;
    skos:definition "A process which does not require a DPIA according to the Data Protection Authorities of Austria and which involves: Image and acoustic processing that exclusively pursue a documentation interest that is not 
aimed at the identifying recording of uninvolved persons or the targeted recording of objects that are suitable for the indirect identification of such persons. Criminal, administrative or civil law purposes may not be prosecuted
within the framework of this exception."@en ;
    dpv:hasPurpose hapt:dpv-Documentation ;
	dpv:hasData tech:ImageContent, tech:AudioContent ;
	dpv:isNotApplicableFor hapt:dpv-Identification, hapt:dpv-Recording, hapt:sector-law-CriminalLaw (under purpose), hapt:sector-law-CivilLaw (under purpose), hapt:dpv-AdministrativeLaw (under purpose), hapt:dpv-UninvolvedPerson, hapt:dpv-IndirectIdentification ;
	dct:source at:DPIANotRequiredList ;
